Spec: Time bounds

Purpose:
  Local-time bounds of the current day, week and year as epoch-millisecond ranges.

Owns:
  ./time_bounds.dart
  /test/domain/time_bounds_test.dart

References:
  /docs/specs/history/04-domain.md

Must:
  A week runs from Monday `00:00:00.000` to Sunday `23:59:59.999` local time.
  A day runs from `00:00:00.000` to `23:59:59.999` local time.
  A year runs from January 1 `00:00` to the sentinel `9223372036854775807`.

Scenario: Sunday belongs to the week that started on Monday
  Given now is a Sunday evening
  When the week bounds are computed
  Then the week starts on the preceding Monday at midnight
